          "textEn": "274\nAble to produce. All the people trapped in the flames of material suffering can only find the path to salvation in you. Meaning: Arjun was aware of the divine qualities of Lord Krishna because in the Kurukshetra war, he\nwas present together, only then he had experienced it. Therefore, regarding Krishna,\nArjun's statement is authentic. Krishna is omnipotent and is the embodiment of the fearlessness of devotees. A devotee of God is always fearless, because God protects him. This physical world\nis like a blazing fire in the forest, which can only be extinguished by the grace of Lord Krishna. The Guru is the representative of the Divine Grace. Therefore, a person burning in the flames of physical existence,\ncan only receive the rain of God's grace through the transparent medium of a self-realized guru.\nThe guru, through his speech, enters the heart of the afflicted person and imparts divine knowledge,\ncan do so, which can extinguish the fire of the material world.\nYou are the first being, the self-existent one, the cause, the supreme being. Maya, appearing with the power of consciousness, is situated only in the self. 23). Meaning of the word:\nYou are the beginning: You are the beginning; the individual is the enjoyer; the absolute is the controller; the material is the nature;\nThe other is the divine; Maya is the material power; Vayudasya is the one who drives away; Chit-Shakti is the power of consciousness;\nIn liberation, there is pure eternal knowledge and bliss; Sthitah is the one who is established; Atmani is one's own.\n\nYou are the beginning, the God, who is expanded in all creation, and you are beyond the material power.\nYou are beyond. You have driven away all the effects of physical power with your spiritual power.\nYou have given. You are constantly situated in eternal bliss and divine knowledge.\nMeaning: In the Bhagavad Gita, God says that the person who takes refuge in the lotus feet of God\ncan escape from the clutches of ignorance. Krishna is like the sun, and Maya or\nthe material world is like darkness. Wherever the light of the sun goes, darkness or\nignorance is immediately removed. Here, the best way to get out of the world of ignorance has been suggested"
