reme state. The holy name of God\nis equivalent to the mighty. God is the almighty divine personality and they have infinite names,\nwhich are inseparable from Him and are equally mighty. At the end of the Bhagavad Gita, God, by giving strength,\nsays that whoever comes completely into His refuge, all his sins are protected."
