e\ncannot achieve desired success in the chanting of the holy name. The seventh offense is to knowingly commit sin on the strength of the holy name. It is said in the scriptures that only by chanting the name of God, all sins\ncan be removed from their effects. The person who takes advantage of this divine method and with this hope"
