ness directs it to go to the refuge of God, as it is said in\nBhagavad Gita (7.19)-- Vasudevah Sarvamiti Mahatma Su Durlabhah. This indicates\nthat in a divine state, neither is there any physical creation, nor is there any causal reservoir for physical nature. The above situation is real on the divine plane. But this is the high of the yogi's pure consciousness"
