eople, slowly rising up, become Saurya (worshippers of the Sun God) or Ganapatya (devotees of Ganapati), or Ganajanardan or GRE Narayana—that is, the people’s worshippers—and then, in search of the eternal soul, rise to the level of those who worship Shiva; then they reach the level of those who worship Lord Vishnu,\nthe Supreme Being, etc., but they are still in the form of the original Lord Vishnu"
