e's own\nstate.\nIn the final stage of his life, Maharaj Rishabhdev remained silent and like a mad man.\nHe continued to wander-- no physical abuse had any effect on him. They, like madmen, grow their matted hair, and seeing them roam naked, the ignorant children and men of the streets"
