rimentally tested all the worlds that roam in the space.\nSince such an experiment is not possible, therefore, we must accept the statement of Shrimad Bhagwat in its original form\nbecause Shridhar Swami, Jiva Goswami, Vishwanath Chakravarti, and other spiritual\nleaders have accepted it. The Vedic method is that the marks of the highest authorities\nshould be followed, and to know what is beyond our imagination, this is the only method."
