rt of the supreme personality, the perfect Supreme Being,\nare, to some extent, independent in performing actions.\nTherefore, to attain devotion to God, one must become a willing associate, and to voluntarily cooperate with those already engaged in devotion,\ncooperating is the first qualification. By providing support to such individuals, the expected devotee will gradually\nbe able to learn the methods of devotion and gradually gain knowledge, and be freed from the impurities of worldly association"
