nd souls change their bodies, who are waiting for liberation, but how did this action first begin? In Bhakti Yoga, the first step is to take refuge in the Guru, and then to inquire about devotion from the Guru. Such curiosity is necessary, so that one is aware of all kinds of crimes committed in the path of devotion"
