xcessively attached to the body,\nsimilarly, the Lord's plays related to creation and destruction are for the worldly men who are excessively attached. Therefore, to impart knowledge about the creator, God, to such worldly men,\nthe functions of the body and the universe are included.\nScientists explain physical actions through many\ntechnical terms of physical method, but these blind scientists are method-makers"
