ingly;--Accordingly;--Acc Srisut Goswami said--Now I will tell you all those subjects which, when asked by King Parikshit, the great sage said to him, \"Oh! Please listen to this carefully.\"\nMeaning: If the answer to every question asked is given by quoting an authoritative scholar,\nthen it satisfies the intellect of the wise.\nEven in the courts, the same method is adopted. The best lawyer presents evidence from previous decisions without incurring any expense to establish his case. This tradition is called the law, and learned officials follow it without giving unnecessary arguments here and there."
