ing to many parts of the world, the great devotee of God and the great sage\nMaitreya, a friend and well-wisher of Krishna Dvaipayana Vyasa, arrived at that place of his own will. Note: Maitreya was a disciple of Maharshi Parashara, the father of Vyasa, the sage in the Vyasa Dhatu. In this way, Vyasadeva and Maitreya"
