          "textEn": "L64\nBut their actions and dealings are actually under the observation of God. Those who can only see the changes of physical elements\nand cannot experience the invisible hands of God behind them\nare certainly less intelligent people, even if they are being advertised as great physicists. Of the elements, of the sky, and of the earth, whatever is above and below.\nOf those, the association of others, and of the qualities, know in their respective numbers. 37). Meaning of the word\n\nBhutanam-- of all the material elements; TH-- shape; Adinam-- etc.; Yat-- in the manner; Yat-tatha-- in the manner; Bhavya- Hey--\nSaumya; Avar-- inferior; Varam-- superior; Tesham- of all of them; Par- beyond, supreme; Brahma; Anusansargat- from the association of the last; Yatha- as much as;\nSankhyam- counting; Gunan- qualities; Viduhu- you can understand..\n\nOh, noble man, all the lower and superior qualities that are found in all the physical elements from the sky to the earth are due to the final touch of God's gaze.\nThese are the gods, the arts, Vishnu, and the darkness of time.\nBecause of their diversity, they speak of their actions, the ocean of consciousness. 38). Meaning of the word\n\nEte--in all these physical elements; Devaah--the controllers; Kalaah--part; Vishnuh--of God; Kaalah--time; Mayah--\nExternal energy; Anshah--part; Liddhinah--like this, embodied; Nanatvat--because of diversity; Swa-kriya--private action;\nAnishah--because of not being able to do; Prochuh--said; Pranajalayah--manifest; Vibhum--to God.. They\nundergo the body through eternity under the power of the external being and they are parts of God. Because\nthey were assigned various tasks of cosmic responsibility, and since they were unable to accomplish them,\ntherefore, they offered the enchanting praises of God in the following manner.\nMeaning: For the arrangement of cosmic work, residing in higher realms,\nthe concept of various controllers of gods is not imaginary as propos