, the Supreme Personality of Godhead. In this way, the exchange of emotions takes place in divine Vaikuntha realms, therefore,\nthe liberation that the non-differential seekers seek is already attained in devotion. Devotees,\nKeeping their individuality intact, while attaining divine bliss, attain liberation themselves. As has been mentioned in the previous\nverse, the destination of devotees is Vaikuntha or Akuntha-Dhishnya--that place where"
