ulous argument to say that God is defeated by his own physical power.\nGod is the master of physical power, But living beings, in a bound state, are controlled by physical power. This is the statement of the Bhagavad Gita. Those Koopamanduka philosophers who present this argument\nthat God is defeated by Satoguna, they themselves remain deluded by the same physical power,"
