entic devotees who are proficient in Vedic knowledge and are free from worldly attachments.\nThrough this authentic listening method, a newly initiated devotee becomes free from all material impurities.\nAnd in this way, he becomes attached to one of the many divine forms of God, whose\ndescription is found in the Vedas. The devotee's attachment to a particular form of God is due to natural tendency. Every living being is fundamentally connected with a particular type of divine service, because it is God's"
