ders of God or are against the harmonious works that God desires.\nThe principle of creation is that God is naturally cheerful and to increase his divine pleasure,\nHe becomes many. Living beings like us, being part of God, are for the purpose of satisfying God's\nsenses. Therefore, whenever any inconsistency arises in that understanding, then the soul\nimmediately comes into the grip of Maya."
