imes called Swarat and Aja.\n\nHere, another important point is made. When the complete Supreme Personality of Godhead\nmanifests, He brings with Him all the finery of Vaikuntha, as a result of which their\nname, form, qualities, materials, and attendants (companions) remain connected to the divine world. Divya"
