nd to help the senses. Meaning: Intellect is the power of discretion, by which any object can be known, and the senses\nget help in selecting. Therefore, the intellect is considered the master of the senses. Intelligence\nis fully realized when it becomes stable in the activities of devotion to Krishna. With the proper use of intellect,\nthe expansion of human consciousness occurs, and the ultimate expansion of consciousness\nis devotion to Krishna."
