dy to another. When the body dies, it thinks that it too is destroyed.\nIn reality, God,\nthis forgetfulness of his relationship with Vishnu is the cause of his destruction. The person who keeps the memory of the original\nrelationship alert, he receives inspiration from God. But this does not mean that God is an enemy of someone and a friend of someone. He helps everyone.\nAnd he who is not fascinated by the influence of material power (Maya), he is saved, and\nHe who becomes deluded, he is destroyed. Therefore it is said--without defeat, there is no death"
