or has already killed them. Therefore, being a self-proclaimed Vaishnava, he advised Shivaji\nto not kill Daksha.\nVaishnavas are called 'par-duk-dukhi' because, although they themselves are not sad in any\nstate, they remain sad from the sorrow of others. Therefore, a Vaishnava should not\nkill anyone by any action of the body or mind, but he should"
