oach done by Shri Bhagavan. He accepts that pathetic state, considering it as the grace of God. He thinks,\n“I would either be punished for my past misdeeds or fall into an even more terrible situation, but God has protected me. In this way, according to the rules of karma, I will receive only a little punishment"
