ng: Devotion is so sublime that whoever devotion, he can obtain desired boons from God\ncan obtain. Bound souls remain very attached to this material world, and by performing religious deeds, they want to gain material benefits of dharma and\nwealth. ©\nViraktashchindeyaratau Bhaktiyogen Bhuyasaa.\nTam nirantarabhavena bhajetaddha vimuktaye. 61)."
