va Maharaj had a real experience that by being illuminated at the spiritual level of the senses,\nhe was able to understand the essence of the Vedic order--that God is the supreme being, He is not without attributes--. They understood this matter immediately. They had the knowledge that for a long time they had been dormant and now"
