ce over this physical nature. Modern scientists are proud of their knowledge that they are discovering new\nmethods and gaining dominance over the laws of physical nature. They understand it as the progress of human civilization. The more they establish dominance over the laws of nature, the more they consider themselves elevated. Initially, Dhruva Maharaj's mindset was like this. They are this physical"
